{"word":"καυστικός","uri":"kaustikos","senses":[{"word":"καυστικός","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">καυστικός,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ή,\nόν</span> :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">pass.</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qu’on peut brûler,\ncombustible, <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">P.A.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 2</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> brûlé par la fièvre,\n<span class=\"aut\">Hpc.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">72</span><span class=\"refpb\">f</span> ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> <span class=\"ital\">act.</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qui a la propriété de\nbrûler, caustique, <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Phys.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 1 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Diosc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 6</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> qui consiste à\nbrûler : <span class=\"grec\">κ. βάσανοι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Spt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">4 Macc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6, 27,</span> torture par le feu ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Cp.</span> <span class=\"grec\">-ώτερος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">P.A.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 2 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Diosc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">l. c.</span></div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Sup.</span> <span class=\"grec\">-ώτατος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cæl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 8, 6</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">καυστός</span>.</div>\n"}]}